#: ../../source/convert-source-map_README.md:156
msgid "toComment([options])"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/convert-source-map_README.md:158
msgid ""
"Converts source map to an inline comment that can be appended to the "
"source-file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/convert-source-map_README.md:160
#: ../../source/convert-source-map_README.md:201
msgid ""
"By default, the comment is formatted like: `//# sourceMappingURL=...`, "
"which you would normally see in a JS source file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/convert-source-map_README.md:163
msgid ""
"When `options.encoding == 'uri'`, the data will be uri encoded, otherwise"
" they will be base64 encoded."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/convert-source-map_README.md:165
#: ../../source/convert-source-map_README.md:203
msgid ""
"When `options.multiline == true`, the comment is formatted like: `/*# "
"sourceMappingURL=... */`, which you would find in a CSS source file."
msgstr ""

